        ("facts.base", "Text: Holy Cross Lake View S.S.S, Wanyange, Jinja", "Holy Cross Lake View S.S.S, Wanyange, Jinja"),
        ("why.title", "Text: Shown here, built elsewhere", "Shown here, built elsewhere"),
        ("why.p1", "Text: A stand at a festival reaches a student once. A programme at", "A stand at a festival reaches a student once. A programme at the school they already attend reaches them every term. So outreach is where the work gets shown, not where it happens."),
        ("why.p2", "Text: That is why our stands are run by students rather than staff", "That is why our stands are run by students rather than staff. Visitors talk to the people who built the things on the table, with mentors behind them for the harder questions. Younger pupils get to watch students only a few years older explain a piece of engineering they made themselves."),
        ("gf.title", "Text: Green Fest 2026", "Green Fest 2026"),
        ("gf.intro", "Text: In July, the Foundation joined the third Laudato Si Green Fe", "In July, the Foundation joined the third Laudato Si Green Festival at Holy Cross Lake View S.S.S: two days of climate action organised by the Laudato Youth movement through its school clubs."),
        ("gf.p1", "Text: Students from a spread of schools exhibited under marquees a", "Students from a spread of schools exhibited under marquees along the school field: the Laudato Youth delegates, visiting primary pupils, and the host school’s own students. The Foundation’s table sat among the student displays rather than in a sponsors’ row, and for most of the day it was staffed by students explaining their own work."),
        ("gf.p2", "Text: The exhibits ranged from a solar array wired to storage and ", "The exhibits ranged from a solar array wired to storage and a multi-stage water-treatment rig to a set of model aircraft that drew a standing crowd of adults, with a queue of younger pupils waiting behind them. The festival closed with certificates."),
        ("gf.c1", "Text: Model aircraft on the exhibition tables.", "Model aircraft on the exhibition tables."),
        ("gf.c2", "Text: Visitors at the model aircraft.", "Visitors at the model aircraft."),
