        ("judge.awards", "Text: The awards for each year are announced by the Foundation. Th", "The awards for each year are announced by the Foundation. The 2026/27 handbook lists an Overall Science Fair Champion, category awards, and awards for the most innovative solution, engineering design, scientific investigation, use of data, environmental and sustainability impact, agriculture and food security, technology and computing, communication, a promising young researcher, and community impact."),
        ("fund.title", "Text: Project funding", "Project funding"),
        ("fund.intro", "Text: Some approved projects receive Foundation funding. It is not", "Some approved projects receive Foundation funding. It is not guaranteed, and a project does not need it to do well."),
